  "gaps": [
    "The capture contains more than one program: the end of an unnamed program (total 180 quarter credits), the BS in Information Technology, General Information Technology, FlexPath option, and the start of the BS in Information Technology, Data Analytics and Artificial Intelligence. This ledger covers the FlexPath General IT program because it is the only program shown completely, with all blocks and a printed total. Please confirm this is the intended program.",
    "This program is measured in FlexPath 'program points', which is not one of the available credit-system options. 'competency-unit' was chosen as the closest match. Program points are neither quarter credits nor WGU competency units, and no conversion was applied.",
    "The total requires a minimum of 27 program points from the 3000-level and above. This level requirement is not captured as a separate ledger line.",
    "The specific upper-division specialization courses (15 program points) are not listed in the capture.",
    "The specific general education course selections are student choices. The FlexPath list in the capture requires a minimum of 2 program points from each of four categories: Communication, Humanities, Natural Science and Mathematics, and Social Science.",
    "Several course titles span line breaks in the capture. Titles were joined from adjacent lines, while each quote shows only the first line.",
    "The capture does not state any residency or institutional-only completion requirement for this program.",
    "The capstone courses are 'Taken during the student’s final two quarters'. This is a timing rule, not a residency requirement.",
    "The BS in Information Technology, Data Analytics and Artificial Intelligence (quarter credits) is cut off in the capture. Its capstone block and printed total are missing, so a complete ledger for it cannot be built from this text."
